<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><transcript><text start="2.32" dur="6.68">United States of America and the Prime</text><text start="4.56" dur="4.44">Minister of the Kingdom of Thailand.</text><text start="18.72" dur="3.639">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Thank you very much.</text><text start="27.599" dur="4.321">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well, thank you very much. This is a</text><text start="29.519" dur="4.801">great honor. We&amp;#39;ve been working on this</text><text start="31.92" dur="4.56">deal for a long time</text><text start="34.32" dur="5.04">and uh it&amp;#39;s going to be a wonderful deal</text><text start="36.48" dur="6.32">for both parties I believe. But I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="39.36" dur="6.24">thrilled to join Prime Minister</text><text start="42.8" dur="5.12">Anutton of Thailand as we sign a</text><text start="45.6" dur="4.4">historic trade deal between our two</text><text start="47.92" dur="4.319">countries. We do a lot of trade with</text><text start="50" dur="5.36">Thailand actually.</text><text start="52.239" dur="5.681">It&amp;#39;s been a cherished ally of the United</text><text start="55.36" dur="4.879">States for more than 70 years and our</text><text start="57.92" dur="4.639">friendship goes back more than 200 years</text><text start="60.239" dur="5.601">and the prime minister is doing a</text><text start="62.559" dur="6.24">fantastic job. Not an easy one, but he&amp;#39;s</text><text start="65.84" dur="4.56">getting it really in shape and he&amp;#39;s done</text><text start="68.799" dur="3.281">it&amp;#39;s being talked about all over the</text><text start="70.4" dur="1.84">world, the job you&amp;#39;re doing. So, thank</text><text start="72.08" dur="2.56">you.</text><text start="72.24" dur="4.4">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I want to congratulate you.</text><text start="74.64" dur="3.839">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; But he goes back more than 200 years in</text><text start="76.64" dur="5.36">what has always been one of America&amp;#39;s</text><text start="78.479" dur="7.041">closest partnerships anywhere in Asia.</text><text start="82" dur="5.68">Last year at the ASEAN summit, it was my</text><text start="85.52" dur="4.08">honor to work with the prime minister to</text><text start="87.68" dur="6.64">forge peace between Thailand and</text><text start="89.6" dur="6.4">Cambodia. We uh solved a really violent</text><text start="94.32" dur="5.28">situation</text><text start="96" dur="6.72">and uh I think I did that. I don&amp;#39;t think</text><text start="99.6" dur="5.68">I got any credit for it. So, just</text><text start="102.72" dur="5.359">another war that I saved, but I get no</text><text start="105.28" dur="6">credit. But that&amp;#39;s okay. I don&amp;#39;t mind. I</text><text start="108.079" dur="4.801">want to save lives. It&amp;#39;s 99.9%.</text><text start="111.28" dur="4.24">But it was it was an honor and you were</text><text start="112.88" dur="6.08">a total professional. Now we&amp;#39;re making</text><text start="115.52" dur="5.36">history once again. Today today&amp;#39;s deal</text><text start="118.96" dur="3.68">lays the foundation for much stronger</text><text start="120.88" dur="4">trading relationship that will bring the</text><text start="122.64" dur="3.759">United States and Thailand closer than</text><text start="124.88" dur="3.2">ever before. And I think we are because</text><text start="126.399" dur="4">of the relationship that we have. I</text><text start="128.08" dur="3.68">think we probably are the closest we&amp;#39;ve</text><text start="130.399" dur="4.961">ever been. We&amp;#39;re going to do a lot of</text><text start="131.76" dur="6.32">trade. Uh Thailand will eliminate all</text><text start="135.36" dur="4.4">tariffs on US exports, which is</text><text start="138.08" dur="4">something that we&amp;#39;ve been after for a</text><text start="139.76" dur="4.24">long time, and remove substantial</text><text start="142.08" dur="3.84">non-tariff barriers on American</text><text start="144" dur="4.64">vehicles, medical devices,</text><text start="145.92" dur="5.039">pharmaceuticals, ethanol, and poultry.</text><text start="148.64" dur="5.28">Thailand will also be buying an</text><text start="150.959" dur="5.441">estimated $2.6 billion in additional US</text><text start="153.92" dur="4.64">agricultural products. That makes our</text><text start="156.4" dur="4.88">farmers very happy. We&amp;#39;re doing a lot of</text><text start="158.56" dur="4.56">great deals for our farmers. This is an</text><text start="161.28" dur="3.52">incredible victory for both countries,</text><text start="163.12" dur="3.839">both the people of Thailand and the</text><text start="164.8" dur="4.32">American people, and I look forward to</text><text start="166.959" dur="4.64">finalizing the details of our formal</text><text start="169.12" dur="5.199">agreement in the coming weeks. Our staff</text><text start="171.599" dur="4.72">is working on it very diligently, and</text><text start="174.319" dur="4.961">it&amp;#39;ll be done, but the concept of what</text><text start="176.319" dur="5.521">we have will be really, very permanent,</text><text start="179.28" dur="4.56">and we&amp;#39;re just about there. And we&amp;#39;re</text><text start="181.84" dur="4.24">going to actually sign a document right</text><text start="183.84" dur="4.319">now. So, I&amp;#39;d like to invite the prime</text><text start="186.08" dur="5.12">minister say to say a few words and then</text><text start="188.159" dur="5.281">we&amp;#39;ll sign a joint statement talking</text><text start="191.2" dur="4.8">about the deal and uh then they&amp;#39;re going</text><text start="193.44" dur="4.24">to finalize it and they this is the more</text><text start="196" dur="4">difficult part because it took us a</text><text start="197.68" dur="5.44">while to get to this point. So, Mr.</text><text start="200" dur="5.519">Prime Minister, please.</text><text start="203.12" dur="3.92">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Thank you, Mr. President, Mr.</text><text start="205.519" dur="4.241">Secretaries,</text><text start="207.04" dur="5.52">distinguished guests, it is a pleasure</text><text start="209.76" dur="4.88">for me to meet you again and I have to</text><text start="212.56" dur="5.28">thank you for bringing us here to this</text><text start="214.64" dur="5.76">point. I&amp;#39;m pleased that we have reached</text><text start="217.84" dur="5.119">a substantial conclusion in our</text><text start="220.4" dur="5.52">negotiations on the agreement on</text><text start="222.959" dur="5.681">reciprocal trade between the United</text><text start="225.92" dur="5.28">States and Thailand. And I believe the</text><text start="228.64" dur="5.36">agreement will bring greater dynamics to</text><text start="231.2" dur="5.679">our trade relations and open new</text><text start="234" dur="4.959">opportunities for all stakeholders.</text><text start="236.879" dur="4.64">Mr. President, your leadership in</text><text start="238.959" dur="5.36">bringing this negotiation to a nice</text><text start="241.519" dur="5.36">conclusion like this is greatly greatly</text><text start="244.319" dur="4.881">appreciated and yet there is still a</text><text start="246.879" dur="5.041">little more to do. I&amp;#39;m confident that</text><text start="249.2" dur="6.16">the agreement will be ready for us to</text><text start="251.92" dur="5.52">sign real soon. Thailand attaches great</text><text start="255.36" dur="4.399">importance to its long-standing</text><text start="257.44" dur="5.44">relationship with the United with the</text><text start="259.759" dur="5.44">United States. Our partnership is beyond</text><text start="262.88" dur="4.08">trade and investment. We remain</text><text start="265.199" dur="4.481">committed to strengthening our</text><text start="266.96" dur="5.12">cooperation across areas of mutual</text><text start="269.68" dur="5.36">interest. Today&amp;#39;s achievement</text><text start="272.08" dur="5.44">demonstrates what our two countries can</text><text start="275.04" dur="4.719">accomplish by working together. I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="277.52" dur="5.6">confident that it will provide a strong</text><text start="279.759" dur="5.761">foundation for an for an even closer and</text><text start="283.12" dur="3.92">more productive partnership in the years</text><text start="285.52" dur="3.993">ahead. Thank you, Mr. President.</text><text start="287.04" dur="4.493">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Thank you very much.</text><text start="289.513" dur="2.02">[applause]</text><text start="329.12" dur="7.4">Thank you. Thank you.</text><text start="332.24" dur="4.28">Okay, we will hold that up.</text><text start="337.328" dur="3.832">[applause]</text><text start="338.16" dur="3">CONGRATULATIONS.</text><text start="341.913" dur="2.02">[applause]</text><text start="344" dur="2.639">Here we go. Here&amp;#39;s some pens for you</text><text start="345.68" dur="2.64">people. My colleagues.</text><text start="346.639" dur="3.521">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Yes, please. [laughter] Come on. Come on</text><text start="348.32" dur="4.4">over.</text><text start="350.16" dur="4.8">Come on over.</text><text start="352.72" dur="4.56">My guys, they don&amp;#39;t. They have enough.</text><text start="354.96" dur="4.239">They have enough of these.</text><text start="357.28" dur="5.359">Please take them.</text><text start="359.199" dur="7.081">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Do you have any questions, please?</text><text start="362.639" dur="3.641">Do you have any questions?</text><text start="369.12" dur="4.24">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; It&amp;#39;s a joint statement agreement between</text><text start="371.28" dur="6">United States of America, the Kingdom of</text><text start="373.36" dur="6">Thailand uh on reciprocal trade. It&amp;#39;s a</text><text start="377.28" dur="4.479">very big actually it&amp;#39;s a very big trade</text><text start="379.36" dur="4.16">deal.</text><text start="381.759" dur="5.56">Okay.</text><text start="383.52" dur="3.799">Thank you very much everybody.</text><text start="388.72" dur="5.36">Thank you once again very much. Thank</text><text start="390.479" dur="4.641">you so much. Any let me know.</text><text start="394.08" dur="1.679">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Thank you. Okay.</text><text start="395.12" dur="4.6">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Congratulations.</text><text start="395.759" dur="3.961">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; No problem. You&amp;#39;re not</text><text start="402.8" dur="3.48">Thank you very much.</text></transcript>